OL,3,GNEWSAMarried councillors lose positions
OL,4,Aafter not turning up to work for six
OL,5,Amonths
OL,6,
OL,7,FA husband and wife lost their positions
OL,8,Fas councillors after failing to attend
OL,9,Fany meetings for half a year.
OL,11,FJules and Bob Rogers had both
OL,12,Frepresented Labour as councillors for
OL,13,Fthe Abersychan and Cwmavon ward on
OL,14,FPontypool Community Council.
OL,16,FBut the local authority has had to
OL,17,Fdeclare two vacancies as the couple had
OL,18,Fnot been turning up for any meetings
OL,19,Ffor at least six months.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
